	(text "CONDUCTIVITY (isolated side)\nU2 Atlas EC OEM (datasheet v3.4): SMBus/I2C only, 10-100 kHz, default address 0x64. VCC 3.0-5.5 V; current 10.6 mA (0 uS) to 26 mA (>=100,000 uS) at 3.3 V.\nVCC from VDD_ISO (U4 NXE1S0303MC, unregulated, about 3.0-3.3 V from VSENS 3.0 V): at the EC OEM 3.0 V minimum, see STATUS.md question.\nSDA/SCL pulled up on the Isolation sheet (R3/R4 4.7k to VDD_ISO): no pull-ups here. INT (pin 7) goes to test pad J5 only; firmware polls register 0x07.\nNC pins 2, 9, 10 float. Pins 4 and 5 are the two probe electrodes (both labelled PRB in the datasheet); the EC OEM has no probe-ground pin,\nso there is no AGND link: J1 centre = EC_PRB1 (pin 4), J1 shell = EC_PRB2 (pin 5). The SMA shell is NOT ground: keep it off GND_ISO and enclosure metal.\nLayout (datasheet p.34): probe traces on top, 0.4 mm, as short as possible, 1 mm from other traces, GND_ISO plane (pin 6) under and around them,\nno vias or exposed metal under U2 (rule area in the footprint). Lost at power-off: active/hibernate, LED, interrupt control (re-write after each VSENS cycle)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 88.9 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b5bff4d4-a85a-4e95-9bc6-d3981948cd0f")
	)
	(text "EC probe input (SMA; Atlas probes ship with BNC: BNC-to-SMA adapter cable)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.2 104.14 0)
		(effects
